From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Codex <codex@invalid>
Date: Sun, 11 Oct 2026 23:25:39 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 10/11] gdctl: Preserve per-monitor target declarations and
 support explicit clearing

Expose configured peak, optional black and HDR gamut policy with uniform auto reset tokens. Preserve configured target fields, color mode and RGB range when changing unrelated layout options. Print effective targets and provenance in properties/verbose output. Add deferred two-monitor preservation, clearing, VERIFY and invalid-range regressions; fixtures are source-derived expectations, not execution receipts.
